      "content": "<!--\n  Headphones Product Poster — 675×1200 JPEG from the HTML Library image set.\n  The width/height attributes reserve the box so the page does not shift\n  while the file downloads.\n-->\n<figure class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl\">\n  <img\n    src=\"https://xnsteam-ai.github.io/Html-library/images/2047935217231663186-1.jpg\"\n    alt=\"Lifestyle product poster for over-ear headphones, worn in frame\"\n    width=\"675\"\n    height=\"1200\"\n    class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-xl\"\n  />\n  <figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Headphones Product Poster · 675×1200</figcaption>\n</figure>\n"
